menu "CSI Motion Sensor (common)"

    config CSI_CHANNEL
        int "Wi-Fi channel used by both sender and receiver (2.4 GHz)"
        range 1 13
        default 11
        help
            Sender and receiver MUST use the same channel. Pick the least
            congested channel in your room (check with a phone Wi-Fi analyzer).

    config CSI_TX_POWER_QDBM
        int "Sender TX power in 0.25 dBm units (8..84)"
        range 8 84
        default 40
        help
            40 = 10 dBm. Lower power shrinks the sensing area and reduces
            interference from far away. 84 = 21 dBm (maximum).
            Used by the sender only.

endmenu
